<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Política de Privacidad – FUNCAPP TECH</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Mono:wght@400;700&family=Syne:wght@400;600;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #0a0a0f;
      --surface: #13131c;
      --card: #1a1a28;
      --accent: #00e5a0;
      --accent2: #7c4dff;
      --accent3: #ff4d6d;
      --text: #f0f0f8;
      --muted: #6b6b8a;
      --border: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
      --sidebar-w: 270px;
    }

    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'Syne', sans-serif;
      min-height: 100vh;
      overflow-x: hidden;
    }

    body::before {
      content: '';
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background-image:
        linear-gradient(rgba(0,229,160,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px),
        linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,229,160,0.025) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 60px 60px;
      pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
      animation: gridShift 25s linear infinite;
    }
    @keyframes gridShift { to { background-position: 60px 60px; } }

    .blob {
      position: fixed; border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(90px); opacity: .12;
      pointer-events: none; z-index: 0;
      animation: drift 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .blob-1 { width:440px;height:440px;background:var(--accent2);top:-120px;left:-160px;animation-delay:0s; }
    .blob-2 { width:360px;height:360px;background:var(--accent); bottom:-80px;right:-80px; animation-delay:-5s; }
    @keyframes drift { from{transform:translate(0,0) scale(1)} to{transform:translate(25px,18px) scale(1.07)} }

    /* ── TOP BAR ── */
    .topbar {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 56px;
      background: rgba(10,10,15,.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 0 24px;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    .topbar-brand {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    .topbar-brand .back-arrow {
      width: 30px; height: 30px; border-radius: 8px;
      background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border);
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted);
      transition: color .2s, border-color .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .topbar-brand:hover .back-arrow { color: var(--text); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,.2); transform: translateX(-2px); }
    .topbar-brand span {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .72rem; letter-spacing: .14em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    /* Lang toggle */
    .lang-toggle {
      display: flex; gap: 4px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 4px;
    }
    .lang-btn {
      padding: 5px 14px;
      border-radius: 100px;
      border: none; cursor: pointer;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: .1em;
      transition: background .25s, color .25s, transform .15s;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .lang-btn.active {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #00c882);
      color: #061210;
    }
    .lang-btn:hover:not(.active) { color: var(--text); transform: scale(1.04); }

    /* ── LAYOUT ── */
    .layout {
      display: flex;
      padding-top: 56px;
      min-height: 100vh;
      position: relative; z-index: 1;
    }

    /* ── SIDEBAR ── */
    .sidebar {
      position: fixed;
      top: 56px; left: 0;
      width: var(--sidebar-w);
      height: calc(100vh - 56px);
      overflow-y: auto;
      padding: 32px 20px 40px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: rgba(10,10,15,.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      scrollbar-width: thin;
      scrollbar-color: var(--card) transparent;
      transition: transform .35s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
      z-index: 90;
    }
    .sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar { width: 4px; }
    .sidebar::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb { background: var(--card); border-radius: 4px; }

    .sidebar-title {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .18em;
      color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }

    .nav-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2px; }

    .nav-item a {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 9px 12px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--muted);
      transition: background .2s, color .2s, padding-left .2s;
      position: relative;
    }
    .nav-item a .nav-num {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .6rem; color: var(--muted);
      min-width: 20px;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .nav-item a:hover,
    .nav-item a.active {
      background: rgba(0,229,160,.07);
      color: var(--accent);
      padding-left: 16px;
    }
    .nav-item a:hover .nav-num,
    .nav-item a.active .nav-num { color: var(--accent); }
    .nav-item a.active::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; left: 0; top: 20%; bottom: 20%;
      width: 3px; border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0,229,160,.6);
    }

    /* Last updated badge in sidebar */
    .sidebar-meta {
      margin-top: 28px;
      padding: 12px 14px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .62rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .sidebar-meta strong { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 700; display: block; margin-bottom: 2px; }

    /* ── MAIN ── */
    .main {
      margin-left: var(--sidebar-w);
      flex: 1;
      padding: 52px 56px 100px;
      max-width: 760px;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .doc-hero {
      margin-bottom: 52px;
      animation: fadeUp .6s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;
    }
    .doc-tag {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      background: rgba(0,229,160,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.2);
      border-radius: 100px;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .65rem; letter-spacing: .12em; color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .doc-tag .pulse { width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
    @keyframes pulse { 0%,100%{opacity:1;transform:scale(1)} 50%{opacity:.3;transform:scale(.6)} }
    .doc-hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
      font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 14px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fff 0%, var(--accent) 70%, var(--accent2) 100%);
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
    }
    .doc-hero p { font-size: .95rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; max-width: 520px; }

    /* Intro card */
    .intro-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.15);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 20px 22px;
      margin-bottom: 48px;
      font-size: .88rem;
      line-height: 1.7;
      color: var(--muted);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      animation: fadeUp .6s .1s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1) both;
    }
    .intro-card::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0;
      width: 4px; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--accent), var(--accent2));
    }

    /* ── SECTIONS ── */
    .section {
      margin-bottom: 52px;
      opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px);
      transition: opacity .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1), transform .5s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1);
    }
    .section.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    .section-header {
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .section-num {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .65rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--accent);
      background: rgba(0,229,160,.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.2);
      border-radius: 8px;
      padding: 4px 9px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .section h2 {
      font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: -.01em;
    }

    .section p, .section li {
      font-size: .9rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .section p { margin-bottom: 14px; }

    /* Sub-sections */
    .subsection { margin: 18px 0 10px; }
    .subsection-title {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .7rem; letter-spacing: .12em;
      color: var(--text); text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .subsection-title::after { content:''; flex:1; height:1px; background:var(--border); }

    /* Lists */
    .bullet-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px; }
    .bullet-list li {
      display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,.02);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 8px;
      transition: background .2s, border-color .2s;
    }
    .bullet-list li:hover { background: rgba(0,229,160,.04); border-color: rgba(0,229,160,.12); }
    .bullet-list li::before {
      content: '▸';
      color: var(--accent); font-size: .7rem;
      margin-top: 3px; flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Third-party card */
    .third-party-card {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 18px 20px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      transition: border-color .3s, transform .3s;
    }
    .third-party-card:hover { border-color: rgba(124,77,255,.3); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .third-party-card .tp-name {
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
      font-size: .75rem; font-weight: 700;
      color: #a67fff; letter-spacing: .08em;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .third-party-card .tp-name::before {
      content: '⬡';
      color: var(--accent2);
    }
    .third-party-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
    .third-party-card ul li {
      font-size: .83rem; color: var(--muted);
      padding: 4px 0 4px 14px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .third-party-card ul li::before { content:'·'; position:absolute; left:4px; color:var(--accent2); }
    .tp-links { margin-top: 12px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .tp-link {
      font-size: .72rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 3px 10px;
      background: rgba(0,229,160,.07);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.15);
      border-radius: 100px;
      transition: background .2s, transform .15s;
      font-family: 'Space Mono', monospace;
    }
    .tp-link:hover { background: rgba(0,229,160,.14); transform: translateY(-1px); }

    /* Rights grid */
    .rights-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(160px, 1fr));
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .right-item {
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      font-size: .82rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      transition: border-color .2s, transform .2s;
    }
    .right-item:hover { border-color: rgba(0,229,160,.2); transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .right-item .ri-icon {
      font-size: 1.1rem; flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* Notice box */
    .notice {
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
      background: rgba(255,77,109,.06);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,77,109,.2);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .notice .notice-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .notice p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

    /* Info box */
    .info-box {
      display: flex; gap: 14px; align-items: flex-start;
      background: rgba(0,229,160,.05);
      border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,.15);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 16px 18px;
      margin-top: 14px;
    }
    .info-box .info-icon { font-size: 1.2rem; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .info-box p { font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }

    /* Contact footer */
    .contact-section {
      margin-top: 60px;
      background: var(--card);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 32px 36px;
      text-align: center;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .contact-section::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center bottom, rgba(0,229,160,.05) 0%, transparent 70%);
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .contact-section h3 { font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .contact-section p { font-size: .88rem; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.6; }
    .contact-btn {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px;
      padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 100px;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff4d6d, #ff7a4d);
      color: #fff; text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700; font-size: .85rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(255,77,109,.35);
      transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
      position: relative; overflow: hidden;
    }
    .contact-btn::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: -100%; width: 60%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,.25), transparent);
      transform: skewX(-20deg); transition: left .5s;
    }
    .contact-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(255,77,109,.5); }
    .contact-btn:hover::after { left: 160%; }

    /* Back to home */
    .back-home {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 28px;
      font-size: .82rem; color: var(--muted);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color .2s;
    }
    .back-home:hover { color: var(--accent); }

    @keyframes fadeUp { from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)} to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)} }

    /* ── MOBILE sidebar drawer ── */
    .sidebar-overlay {
      display: none;
      position: fixed; inset: 0;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,.6);
      backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
      z-index: 89;
    }
    .menu-fab {
      display: none;
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 24px; right: 24px;
      width: 52px; height: 52px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--accent), #00c882);
      border: none; cursor: pointer;
      color: #061210; font-size: 1.3rem;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,229,160,.45);
      z-index: 200;
      transition: transform .2s;
    }
    .menu-fab:hover { transform: scale(1.1); }

    @media (max-width: 820px) {
      .sidebar {
        transform: translateX(calc(-1 * var(--sidebar-w)));
      }
      .sidebar.open {
        transform: translateX(0);
        box-shadow: 4px 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,.5);
      }
      .sidebar-overlay { display: block; opacity: 0; pointer-events: none; transition: opacity .3s; }
      .sidebar-overlay.open { opacity: 1; pointer-events: all; }
      .main { margin-left: 0; padding: 32px 24px 80px; }
      .menu-fab { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 480px) {
      .topbar-brand span { display: none; }
      .main { padding: 28px 18px 80px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-2"></div>

  <!-- TOP BAR -->
  <div class="topbar">
    <a class="topbar-brand" href="index.html">
      <div class="back-arrow">←</div>
      <span>FUNCAPP TECH</span>
    </a>
    <div class="lang-toggle">
      <button class="lang-btn active" id="btnEs" onclick="setLang('es')">ES</button>
      <button class="lang-btn"        id="btnEn" onclick="setLang('en')">EN</button>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="layout">

    <!-- SIDEBAR -->
    <nav class="sidebar" id="sidebar" aria-label="Tabla de contenido">
      <div class="sidebar-title" data-i18n="nav_title">Contenido</div>
      <ul class="nav-list" id="navList">
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#intro"   data-i18n="nav0"><span class="nav-num">00</span>Introducción</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s1"      data-i18n="nav1"><span class="nav-num">01</span>Información que recopilamos</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s2"      data-i18n="nav2"><span class="nav-num">02</span>Uso de la información</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s3"      data-i18n="nav3"><span class="nav-num">03</span>Servicios de terceros</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s4"      data-i18n="nav4"><span class="nav-num">04</span>Base legal</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s5"      data-i18n="nav5"><span class="nav-num">05</span>Conservación</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s6"      data-i18n="nav6"><span class="nav-num">06</span>Seguridad</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s7"      data-i18n="nav7"><span class="nav-num">07</span>Derechos</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s8"      data-i18n="nav8"><span class="nav-num">08</span>Menores</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s9"      data-i18n="nav9"><span class="nav-num">09</span>Transferencias</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#s10"     data-i18n="nav10"><span class="nav-num">10</span>Cambios</a></li>
        <li class="nav-item"><a href="#contact" data-i18n="nav11"><span class="nav-num">✉</span>Contacto</a></li>
      </ul>
      <div class="sidebar-meta">
        <strong data-i18n="last_updated">Última actualización</strong>
        <span>9 de abril de 2026</span>
      </div>
    </nav>

    <div class="sidebar-overlay" id="sidebarOverlay" onclick="closeSidebar()"></div>

    <!-- MAIN CONTENT -->
    <main class="main">

      <!-- Hero -->
      <div class="doc-hero" id="intro">
        <div class="doc-tag"><span class="pulse"></span><span data-i18n="tag_label">Aviso de Privacidad</span></div>
        <h1 data-i18n="doc_title">Política de Privacidad</h1>
        <p data-i18n="doc_subtitle">Este documento describe cómo FUNCAPP TECH recopila, usa y protege la información cuando usas nuestras aplicaciones.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="intro-card" data-i18n="intro_card">
        Esta política aplica a todas las aplicaciones actuales y futuras desarrolladas y publicadas por Funcapp en plataformas como Google Play. Al usar nuestras Aplicaciones, aceptas esta política.
      </div>

      <!-- S1 -->
      <section class="section" id="s1">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-num">01</span>
          <h2 data-i18n="s1_title">Información que recopilamos</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="subsection">
          <div class="subsection-title" data-i18n="s1a_title">a) Información no personal</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li data-i18n="s1a_1">Tipo de dispositivo</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1a_2">Sistema operativo</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1a_3">Idioma del dispositivo</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1a_4">Dirección IP (anonimizada cuando sea posible)</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1a_5">Identificadores publicitarios</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="subsection">
          <div class="subsection-title" data-i18n="s1b_title">b) Datos de uso</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li data-i18n="s1b_1">Interacciones dentro de las Aplicaciones</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1b_2">Datos de rendimiento y errores</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="subsection">
          <div class="subsection-title" data-i18n="s1c_title">c) Contenido del usuario</div>
          <ul class="bullet-list">
            <li data-i18n="s1c_1">El contenido (como documentos escaneados) se procesa localmente en el dispositivo</li>
            <li data-i18n="s1c_2">No almacenamos ni compartimos este contenido en servidores externos</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="info-box">
          <span class="info-icon">🔒</span>
          <p data-i18n="s1_note">Tu contenido nunca sale de tu dispositivo. Todo el procesamiento es local y sin conexión a servidores de Funcapp.</p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- S2 -->
      <section class="section" id="s2">
        <div class="section-header">
          <span class="section-num">02</span>
          <h2 data-i18n="s2_title">Uso de la información</h2>
        </div>
        <p data-i18n="s2_intro">La información se utiliza para:</p>
        <ul class="bullet-list">
          <li data-i18n="s2_1">Operar y mantener las Aplicaciones</li>
